POLNO    DFHMDF POS=(6,20),LENGTH=10,ATTRB=(UNPROT)     policy number   00000100
PREMIUM  DFHMDF POS=(7,20),LENGTH=9,ATTRB=(UNPROT)
ERRMSG   DFHMDF POS=(23,1),LENGTH=70,ATTRB=(PROT,BRT)                   00000120
ZLIMAP20 DFHMSD TYPE=FINAL
         END
